@789 = ~Wrath of the Skies~
@7810 = ~Wrath of the Skies (Alteration)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature / 5 m radius
Saving Throw: special

This spell unleashes the wrath of the skies upon a creature. The spell must be cast outdoors, otherwise it would have no effect. When the spell is cast, one of the many falling stars that cross the sky of Abeir-Toril is diverted from its course and guided by spell to crash into the target.
Upon impact, the target suffers 15D10 points of damage. All creatures within 5 meters around will suffer 10D10 points of damage.
The explosion caused by the impact of the meteor is so brutal that it ignores magic resistance of the target and allows no saving throw to reduce damage.
All creatures who have suffered the impact could remain stunned for 1D4 +2 rounds if they fail a save vs. breath weapon (at -2 for the initial victim).~
@78101 = ~Wrath of the Skies (Alteration)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: one creature / 5 m radius
Saving Throw: special

This spell unleashes the wrath of the skies upon a creature. The spell must be cast outdoors, otherwise it would have no effect. When the spell is cast, one of the many falling stars that cross the sky of Abeir-Toril is diverted from its course and guided by spell to crash into the target.
