@7811 = ~Ethereal Cover~
@7812 = ~Ethereal Cover (Abjuration)
Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / 2 levels
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell covers the caster in ether. Any weapon that tries to hit him must go through this cover, and thus meet the requirements for striking an ethereal creature. As long as the caster is protected by this cover, he cannot be hit by non-magical weapons, and only powerful magical weapons can affect him. It takes an enchanted weapon of at least +1 per 4 levels of the caster to hit him (as an example, he can be hit only by +4 weapon minimum at level 16, with a maximum "at least +5" at level 20).~
@78121 = ~Ethereal Cover (Abjuration)
Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell covers the caster in ether. Any weapon that tries to hit him must go through this cover, and thus meet the requirements for striking an ethereal creature. As long as the caster is protected by this cover, he cannot be hit by non-magical weapons, and only magical weapons of +5 enchantment or higher can affect him.~
@78122 = ~Ethereal Cover (Abjuration)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell covers the recipient in ether. Any weapon that tries to hit him must go through this cover, and thus meet the requirements for striking an ethereal creature. As long as the recipient is protected by this cover, he cannot be hit by non-magical weapons, and only magical weapons of +5 enchantment or higher can affect him.~
@781221 = ~Ethereal Cover (Abjuration)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell covers the recipient in ether. Any weapon that tries to hit him must go through this cover, and thus meet the requirements for striking an ethereal creature. As long as the recipient is protected by this cover, he cannot be hit by non-magical weapons, and only magical weapons of +5 enchantment or higher can affect him.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: it takes at least a +3 weapon to hit them for 1 turn.~

@7813 = ~Mass Disorder~
@7814 = ~Mass Disorder (Enchantment)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: special
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: cube up to 18 meters on each side
Saving Throw: negates

By casting this spell, the warlord attempts to destroy the minds of all creatures in the chosen area. Those that fail their save suffer cerebral trauma. Since he does not fully understand the workings of the brain, both the effects and their duration vary: weakness, confusion, stun, dizziness, migraine, and similar conditions. A successful dispel can shorten the effect.
From level 22, the spell can cause more serious injuries: madness, severe mental impairment or a vegetative state. These effects are permanent; only Greater Restoration or Wish can restore the victims' faculties.~
@78141 = ~Mass Disorder (Enchantment)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: special
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: cube up to 18 meters on each side
Saving Throw: negates

By casting this spell, the warlord attempts to destroy the minds of all creatures in the chosen area. Those that fail their save suffer cerebral trauma. Since he does not fully understand the workings of the brain, both the effects and their duration vary: weakness, confusion, stun, dizziness, migraine, and similar conditions. A successful dispel can shorten the effect.
More serious injuries can cause permanent madness, severe mental impairment or a vegetative state; only Greater Restoration or Wish can restore the victims' faculties.~

@7815 = ~Executioner's Expertise~
@7816 = ~Executioner's Expertise (Divination)
Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds / level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to instinctively detect weaknesses of other creatures, granting him a +4 bonus to attack rolls and +4 to critical hits (if the character usually scores a critical hit on 20, he can score one on 16-20).~
@78161 = ~You already have the Expert's Eye~
@78162 = ~Executioner's Expertise (Divination)
Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to instinctively detect weaknesses of other creatures, granting him a +4 bonus to attack rolls and +4 to critical hits (if the character usually scores a critical hit on 20, he can score one on 16-20).~
@78163 = ~Executioner's Expertise (Divination)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the recipient to instinctively detect weaknesses of other creatures, granting him a +4 bonus to attack rolls and +4 to critical hits (if the character usually scores a critical hit on 20, he can score one on 16-20).~
@781631 = ~Executioner's Expertise (Divination)
Level: 8
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the recipient to instinctively detect weaknesses of other creatures, granting him a +4 bonus to attack rolls and +4 to critical hits (if the character usually scores a critical hit on 20, he can score one on 16-20), until the expiration of the spell.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: they gain a +3 bonus to attack rolls and to critical hits for 27 rounds.~

@7817 = ~Unleash the Beast~
@7818 = ~Unleash the Beast (Alteration)
Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round / level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

A warlord who realizes that his inner power must come from a powerful magical ancestor can use this spell to awaken the creature whose mark remains in his blood.
The nature of this ancestry is revealed the first time the spell is cast: the caster turns into a terrifying pit fiend, gaining all of its physical attributes:
Strength: 18/00
Armor Class: -5
Movement Speed: 11
Attacks per round: 5, including a bite that can fatally poison
Regeneration: 2 HP per round
Can only be hit by weapons of +3 enchantment or higher
Immune to fire and poison
Cold resistance: 50%

He does not gain, however, any extra magical power, nor extra magic resistance. All his equipment is melted into the new shape, and any newly acquired equipment will be the same (including weapons created by a spell).
There is one major drawback in using this spell: a 5% chance each time it is cast that the warlord also gets the savagery of the beast and loses control: he attacks friends and foes indiscriminately, until the expiration of the spell.~
@78181 = ~Lose Control~
@78182 = ~Weapon Merged into Transformed Body~
